---
/* Section__HowItWorks
   Below-hero explainer for the home page. Frames the Dojo against the
   Kauffman Fellowship + Special Interest Groups (wisdom & network →
   contextual knowledge), and positions FullStack VC as the procedural-skill
   counterpart. Then renders a three-tier relationship diagram
   (Dojo → All Hands ‖ Working Groups → Projects) and four explainer cards.

   Pure semantic tokens. Mode-aware. No props — all copy lives in this file
   so the home page composes it as a one-liner. */
---

<section class="hiw" aria-labelledby="hiw-heading">
  <header class="hiw__header">
    <p class="hiw__eyebrow">How the Dojo works</p>
    <h2 id="hiw-heading" class="hiw__heading">
      Wisdom and network + <span class="hiw__heading-accent">a deliberate tech stack and AI mastery</span> can make you a <span class="hiw__heading-accent"> FullStack VC</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="hiw__intro">
      <p>
        The <strong>Kauffman Fellowship</strong> — and its alumni <strong>Special Interest Groups</strong> —
        offer value that is treasured in venture: <em>contextual</em> knowledge:
        pattern recognition, relationships, exposure to deals and ideas across an unmatched network.
        Wisdom and acces are paramount in venture. Vital, and not going anywhere.
      </p>
      <p>
        But the new operating environemnt for VC can be amplifed by, if not requires <em>procedural</em> craft — using the rich features of myriad apps. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Now add AI: writing the prompts, wiring the agents, managing the artifacts and output, querying the data. Superpowers can be harnessed to streamline the workflow that turns scattered signal into
        a partner-meeting-ready memo, better decisions, explosive deal scouting, ambient awareness of portfolio management, auto-updated materials for LP outreach, and more. That kind of knowledge emerges from doing - greasy elbows and calloused hands, not just heads. It's a different muscle,
        learned by doing alongside peers who are also doing.
      </p>
      <p class="hiw__intro-pop">
        <strong>Dojos</strong> are a deliberate alteration of the SIG format for members of the Kauffman + adjacent VC community come to
        practice that craft together. It's <em>complementary</em> with the Fellowship, Society, and Network. No degree, no professors, no curriculum to graduate from.
        Just a working community of practice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hierarchy diagram: Dojo → All Hands → (Working Groups → Projects) -->
  <div class="hiw__diagram" role="img" aria-label="Hierarchy: the Dojo orchestrates All Hands; All Hands is the parent of both Working Groups and Projects; Working Groups choose and run Projects.">
    <!-- Tier 1: Dojo -->
    <div class="hiw__tier hiw__tier--top">
      <div class="hiw__node hiw__node--dojo">
        <p class="hiw__node-label">Dojo</p>
        <p class="hiw__node-sub">FullStack VC · community of practice</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tier 2: All Hands (alone, parent of WG + Projects) -->
    <div class="hiw__tier hiw__tier--mid">
      <div class="hiw__node hiw__node--all-hands">
        <p class="hiw__node-label">All Hands</p>
        <p class="hiw__node-sub">Monthly · everyone welcome</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tier 3: Working Groups → Projects (siblings, with arrow showing flow) -->
    <div class="hiw__tier hiw__tier--bot">
      <div class="hiw__node hiw__node--working-groups">
        <p class="hiw__node-label">Working Groups</p>
        <p class="hiw__node-sub">Theme-based · member-led</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 16" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
          <line x1="0" y1="8" x2="68" y2="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
          <polygon points="68,2 80,8 68,14" fill="currentColor" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hiw__node hiw__node--projects">
        <p class="hiw__node-label">Projects</p>
        <p class="hiw__node-sub">Concrete work · many-to-many</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Explainer: outer container = the Dojo (border + violet tint).
       Left zone = Dojo's own intro panel.
       Right zone = a 3-card grid for All Hands / Working Groups / Projects. -->
  <div class="hiw__cards" role="group" aria-label="Components of the Dojo community">
    <article class="hiw__dojo-panel">
      <p class="hiw__card-eyebrow">Umbrella</p>
      <h3 class="hiw__card-title hiw__card-title--dojo">Dojo</h3>
      <p class="hiw__card-body">
        Kauffman AI SIG & FullStack VC's working community. A place to build hard-skill fluency in AI, agents, data,
        and workflows alongside peers — not a program with a syllabus, but a practice with people.
      </p>
      <p class="hiw__dojo-tagline">Inside the Dojo:</p>
    </article>

    <ul class="hiw__children">
      <li class="hiw__card">
        <p class="hiw__card-eyebrow">Watering hole</p>
        <h3 class="hiw__card-title">All Hands</h3>
        <p class="hiw__card-body">
          Monthly Zoom webinar facilitated by the Kauffman Fellows Community Manager. A guest presenter
          for part of the meeting; working groups present results for the rest. <em>Open to all.</em>
          The right entry point if you're "just curious" — most members start here.
        </p>
        <a class="hiw__card-link" href="/webinars/">See upcoming All Hands →</a>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__card">
        <p class="hiw__card-eyebrow">Practice layer</p>
        <h3 class="hiw__card-title">Working Groups</h3>
        <p class="hiw__card-body">
          Theme-based small communities led by members. Cadence varies — some meet weekly, some
          rarely meet and collaborate digitally instead. Soft expectations about participation
          (social, not enforced). Each group self-organizes around recurring problems.
        </p>
        <a class="hiw__card-link" href="/working-groups/">Browse working groups →</a>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__card">
        <p class="hiw__card-eyebrow">Concrete work</p>
        <h3 class="hiw__card-title">Projects</h3>
        <p class="hiw__card-body">
          Specific artifacts that working groups commit to building or learning together — a
          workflow, a prototype, a methodology, a library. Many-to-many with working groups (one
          project can serve multiple groups, one group can run several projects).
        </p>
        <a class="hiw__card-link" href="/projects/">See active projects →</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.5rem clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .hiw__header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
  }
  .hiw__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .hiw__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .hiw__heading-accent {
    background: var(--fx-headline-gradient, none);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .hiw__intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }
  .hiw__intro p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .hiw__intro strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .hiw__intro em {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  :global([data-mode="light"]) .hiw__intro em {
    color: #5b21b6;
  }
  :global([data-mode="dark"]) .hiw__intro em {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }
  :global([data-mode="vibrant"]) .hiw__intro em {
    color: #caff5c;
  }
  .hiw__intro-pop {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* ---------- Hierarchy diagram ---------- */
  .hiw__diagram {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;            /* tier spacing controlled by per-tier padding + connectors */
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--fx-card-border);
    box-shadow: var(--fx-card-shadow);
  }
  .hiw__tier {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }
  /* Tier vertical spacing — the trailing padding leaves room for the connector. */
  .hiw__tier--top { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hiw__tier--mid { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hiw__tier--bot { padding-top: 0; }

  /* ---- Connector lines ---- */
  /* Tier 1 → Tier 2: single vertical line down from Dojo to All Hands. */
  .hiw__tier--top::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0.5rem;
    width: 2px;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.55;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  /* Tier 2 → Tier 3: vertical drop from All Hands, then horizontal branch
     reaching the centers of Working Groups (left) and Projects (right). */
  .hiw__tier--mid::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 100%;
    width: 2px;
    height: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.55;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .hiw__tier--bot::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1rem;
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  /* Drop-down stubs from the horizontal branch to each child node. */
  .hiw__tier--bot .hiw__node--working-groups::before,
  .hiw__tier--bot .hiw__node--projects::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: -1rem;
    width: 2px;
    height: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.55;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  /* Tier nodes (cards) */
  .hiw__node {
    flex: 0 1 auto;
    min-width: 14rem;
    max-width: 22rem;
    padding: 1.125rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hiw__node:hover {
    border-color: var(--fx-card-border-hover);
    box-shadow: var(--fx-card-shadow-hover);
  }
  .hiw__node--dojo {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 8%, var(--color-surface));
    max-width: 32rem;
  }
  .hiw__node--all-hands { max-width: 26rem; }
  .hiw__node--working-groups { max-width: 18rem; }
  .hiw__node--projects { max-width: 18rem; }

  .hiw__node-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .hiw__node--dojo .hiw__node-label {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .hiw__node-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  /* ---- Arrow connector: Working Groups → Projects ---- */
  .hiw__arrow {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 4rem;
    height: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 0.85;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .hiw__arrow svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Mobile: stack Tier 3 vertically; rotate arrow + swap horizontal branch
     for a single vertical line from All Hands. */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hiw__tier--bot {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    /* Hide the horizontal branch + the per-node drop stubs in stacked mode;
       the existing vertical drop from All Hands suffices. */
    .hiw__tier--bot::before { display: none; }
    .hiw__tier--bot .hiw__node--working-groups::before,
    .hiw__tier--bot .hiw__node--projects::before { display: none; }

    /* Arrow becomes a downward connector between WG and Projects. */
    .hiw__arrow {
      width: 1rem;
      height: 2rem;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Explainer: Dojo container with 3 children inside ----------
     Outer .hiw__cards = the Dojo card (border + violet tint).
     Left zone = Dojo's intro panel; right zone = the 3 child cards.
     Mirrors the diagram: All Hands / Working Groups / Projects all live
     under the Dojo umbrella, visualized as nested cards inside a
     primary-bordered container. */
  .hiw__cards {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 6%, var(--fx-card-bg));
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--fx-card-shadow);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .hiw__cards {
      /* Wide: Dojo intro on the left (~16rem), 3 child cards on the right. */
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 18rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /* Left zone — Dojo intro panel (no separate border; the outer container
     already provides it. Just content. Anchored top-left.) */
  .hiw__dojo-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.25rem;
  }
  .hiw__dojo-tagline {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 0.875rem;
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-top: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 35%, var(--color-border));
  }

  /* Right zone — 3 child cards, sub-grid */
  .hiw__children {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .hiw__children { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  /* Card style — the three children. They sit ON the violet-tinted Dojo
     surface, so they use --fx-card-bg (which is the un-tinted card bg)
     to "pop out" of the container. */
  .hiw__card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    background: var(--fx-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--fx-card-border);
    box-shadow: var(--fx-card-shadow);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
  }
  .hiw__card:hover {
    border-color: var(--fx-card-border-hover);
    box-shadow: var(--fx-card-shadow-hover);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .hiw__card-eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .hiw__card-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .hiw__card-title--dojo {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    background: var(--fx-headline-gradient, none);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hiw__card-body {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .hiw__card-body em {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .hiw__card-link {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }
  .hiw__card-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>

